                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4dec9bb-f80c-3a51-9d57-63e65f22f0f9",
                        "entry_id": "006174b1-34c5-30b7-8480-69e1a1fc237d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An additional payment made when remargining."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2872c9a-d5a5-46ab-a054-a097e12ec0db",
                                "sense_id": "b4dec9bb-f80c-3a51-9d57-63e65f22f0f9",
                                "text": "Order received from Mr. H.E. Beckett to buy ten shares Tennessee Coal and Iron at 17¼, remargin required, $30."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff6887d6-a520-46fb-8650-9c83ef3bf605",
                                "sense_id": "b4dec9bb-f80c-3a51-9d57-63e65f22f0f9",
                                "text": "but it will be recalled that each original Contract purchased cost at least $100 as a Margin; that the exchanging from one month to another cost $100 if the Market has declined; that a decline of 17 points (if Dealer is not well rated) will call for an additional $100, and a subsequent decline of a similar number of points calls for a remargin of like amount."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4cb8d289-ac0c-3815-9fcc-0517d2c31bfd",
                        "entry_id": "006174b1-34c5-30b7-8480-69e1a1fc237d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of remargining."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26994143-7ead-4d9c-985a-64d6b4767bc1",
                                "sense_id": "4cb8d289-ac0c-3815-9fcc-0517d2c31bfd",
                                "text": "He was unable to explain to our satisfaction how he could handle 10 shares on $30 margin “so that all transactions made under the double trading system are protected and there are no calls for remargins.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b6daab9-1510-42c6-bad9-8a5551e2be67",
                                "sense_id": "4cb8d289-ac0c-3815-9fcc-0517d2c31bfd",
                                "text": "The third and fourth rows of Figures 1 and 2 show how the grace period and the remargin period affect EPE."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d39667e6-9a0d-4aa5-a6f1-fe4093ef370a",
                                "sense_id": "4cb8d289-ac0c-3815-9fcc-0517d2c31bfd",
                                "text": "As illustrated in Figure 5.1, at some point far in the future it is known that a position is likely to be well-collateralised and hence the main concern is the relatively small amount of risk over the remargin period."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
